OL,3,GNEWSABeloved children's book inspires
OL,4,Acouple's big day
OL,5,
OL,6,FA children's book became the unlikely
OL,7,Finspiration for the theme of a couple's
OL,8,Fwedding, thanks to their young son.
OL,10,FSarah and Warren Oliveira, who tied the
OL,11,Fknot at Oaty and Joey's Playbarn on Les
OL,12,FGigands in Guernsey in October,
OL,13,Fdesigned elements of their big day
OL,14,Faround Julia Donaldson's The
OL,15,FScarecrows' Wedding.
OL,17,FThe story, which is illustrated by Axel
OL,18,FScheffler, revolves around scarecrows
OL,19,FBetty O'Barley and Harry O'Hay who get
OL,20,Fengaged and try to plan their perfect
OL,21,Fwedding.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
