OL,3,GNEWSABeloved children's book inspires
OL,4,Acouple's big day
OL,5,
OL,6,FSarah said she had initially wanted a
OL,7,FMediterranean-themed wedding, but the
OL,8,Fcouple's four-year-old son Isaac had
OL,9,Fother ideas having watched the book's
OL,10,FTV adaptation on BBC One at Christmas.
